+## DiegeticUI v2 additions (holistic setups, looks, blur)
+
+### Quick Setup (`EDiegeticScreenKind`, `ApplyQuickSetup`)
+- One setting at the top of the screen's Details sets Material, Display, Placement, Use, Presence, Updates, size and Look for a kind (all other settings back to their defaults first; Blur Background Blur Widgets kept). Applied in `PostEditChangeProperty` before Super, and from Blueprint. Kinds:
