+  - **Monitor:** Draw Size 1920 x 1080, Display Mesh Surface (pick the mesh), Clean.
+  - **Hologram:** 100 x 60 cm @ 10, Hologram, Face Camera (Upright), Wake 1200 with Hide, Two Sided.
+  - **Hologram Menu:** 70 x 45 cm @ 16, Hologram (Edge Fade 0.2, Glitch 0.05), In Front Of Player, Focus View with Move Camera and Block Pawn Input off, Every Frame, Start Shown off (Open Diegetic Menu).
+  - **Device Display:** 12 x 8 cm @ 24, LCD Panel, Not Usable, When Changed.
+  - **Sign:** Clean, Not Usable, When Changed (heartbeat 0.5/s), Max Update Distance 3000.
+  - **Glass Panel:** 120 x 70 cm @ 12, Frosted Glass.
